 "chunks": {
  "a1": {
   "text": "This is Plinth, a payment gateway for USDC.",
   "beat": "hero",
   "start": 0.5,
   "end": 3.116
  },
  "a2": {
   "text": "Instead of reading about it, let's use it, starting at the front page.",
   "beat": "hero",
   "start": 3.416,
   "end": 7.423
  },
  "a3": {
   "text": "Every invoice gets its own address, and the money lands in a vault only the merchant can open.",
   "beat": "idea",
   "start": 8.323,
   "end": 14.266
  },
  "b1": {
   "text": "I sign in to the merchant dashboard.",
   "beat": "signin",
   "start": 16.166,
   "end": 18.246
  },
  "b2": {
   "text": "It starts with one question: how do you want to get paid? A link, your own website, or a chat with an AI assistant.",
   "beat": "paths",
   "start": 27.583,
   "end": 34.957
  },
  "c1": {
   "text": "First, where will the money land? A vault, balance zero, one owner wallet, and no admin role for the gateway.",
   "beat": "vault0",
   "start": 37.057,
   "end": 43.947
  },
  "d1": {
   "text": "Let's sell something. A payment link: a name, twenty-five USDC, a short description.",
   "beat": "create",
   "start": 48.157,
   "end": 53.588
  },
  "d2": {
   "text": "One click, and it's live.",
   "beat": "live",
   "start": 55.596,
   "end": 57.143
  },
  "e1": {
   "text": "Now I'm the customer. I open the link and review what I'm paying for.",
   "beat": "cust",
   "start": 61.787,
   "end": 66.05
  },
  "e2": {
   "text": "A wallet isn't connected here, so I'll pay the other way: straight to an address.",
   "beat": "nowallet",
   "start": 67.045,
   "end": 71.57
  },
  "e3": {
   "text": "This address and this QR code belong to this one order.",
   "beat": "addr",
   "start": 74.348,
   "end": 78.101
  },
  "e4": {
   "text": "I copy it, and send exactly twenty-five USDC from my wallet. A real transaction, on a local test chain.",
   "beat": "send",
   "start": 79.787,
   "end": 86.964
  },
  "e5a": {
   "text": "The page is watching the chain.",
   "beat": "chain",
   "start": 87.564,
   "end": 89.457
  },
  "e5b": {
   "text": "Detected.",
   "beat": "chain",
   "start": 89.964,
   "end": 90.864
  },
  "e5c": {
   "text": "Verified.",
   "beat": "chain",
   "start": 91.114,
   "end": 92.073
  },
  "e5d": {
   "text": "Final.",
   "beat": "chain",
   "start": 92.264,
   "end": 93.02
  },
  "e5e": {
   "text": "Settling.",
   "beat": "chain",
   "start": 93.364,
   "end": 94.171
  },
  "e5f": {
   "text": "And then: payment complete. The funds are in the merchant's vault.",
   "beat": "chain",
   "start": 96.264,
   "end": 99.985
  },
  "f1": {
   "text": "Back on the merchant side, the overview already knows: twenty-five received, a five cent fee, twenty-four ninety-five delivered.",
   "beat": "over",
   "start": 109.164,
   "end": 117.463
  },
  "f2": {
   "text": "The payment shows as settled. Its page lists every step the backend recorded, from detection to the relayer's sweep.",
   "beat": "detail",
   "start": 121.263,
   "end": 128.825
  },
  "f3": {
   "text": "In settlements, the relayer paid the network fee, and the destination is my vault. And the vault itself: from zero, to twenty-four ninety-five.",
   "beat": "settle",
   "start": 129.625,
   "end": 138.818
  },
  "g1": {
   "text": "If you'd rather automate this, it's one API call. The app even hands you the snippet.",
   "beat": "api",
   "start": 140.718,
   "end": 146.361
  },
  "g2a": {
   "text": "I run it with my test key,",
   "beat": "term",
   "start": 147.161,
   "end": 148.736
  },
  "g2b": {
   "text": "and the order shows up in the dashboard, waiting for payment.",
   "beat": "pays",
   "start": 151.561,
   "end": 154.908
  },
  "g3": {
   "text": "Every step also sends a signed webhook to your server. Detected, confirmed, settled, completed. Each one delivered, and acknowledged.",
   "beat": "hooks",
   "start": 155.627,
   "end": 164.598
  },
  "h1": {
   "text": "A link, an address, proof from the chain, and money in a vault only you control.",
   "beat": "end",
   "start": 165.598,
   "end": 170.433
  },
  "h2": {
   "text": "Plinth. Non-custodial stablecoin payments, built on Arc.",
   "beat": "end",
   "start": 170.733,
   "end": 174.701
  }
 }
}